            "review_text": "ThanhHuynh\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nGreat place for traditional and authentic northern simple food\nAug 2016 • Solo\nI was back to this place again yesterday. It was packed at the moment I arrived. Generally, the place is clean, staffs were efficient and attentive. \nI order the traditional dish \"Bun dau\", It was quickly served. Amazed by that when you have a lot of clients. The tofu was excellent, nicely fried, the steam pork was tender. The \"mam tom - shrimp paste\" was very nice. \nWithout doubt, this is my to be place, in replacement of another \"used to be good\" place. \nPlease keep it simple and keep it good.\nRead more\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 19, 2016",
